  "description": "All things in this world have a price. But what if people did too? With the mysterious \"Social Coin\" app appearing on phones all over the world, people are now \"priced\" according to their reputation and character. While those worth high prices thrive, those worth low prices are in danger of facing ostracization, discrimination, or even death.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
